{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object not visible, scan area. If found, move to object. If close, take and process it.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = ScanForObjects    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <SubTree ID = FindAndTakeObject    />\"",
